        <para id="para-00099">Felitti, V. J., Anda, R. F., Nordenberg, D., Williamson, D. F., Spitz, A. M., Edwards, V., Koss, M. P., &amp; Marks, J. S. (1998). Relationship of childhood abuse and household dysfunction to many of the leading causes of death in adults. The adverse childhood experiences (ACE) study. <emphasis effect="italics">American Journal of Preventative Medicine, 14</emphasis>(4), 245–258. https://doi.org/10.1016/S0749-3797(98)00017-8</para>
